        SEQUENCE OF COMMANDS TO INSERT NEW ERROR MESSAGES


1.      EDIT PARAMETER FILE.  (PARU.32.SR IS PARAMETER FILE FOR SYSERMES.SR)

2.      CREATE NEW MASM.PS IF PARU.32.SR WAS CHANGED.

3.      EDIT XXXERMES.SR.

4.      EMASM PARXXX XXXERMES (AS SHOWN IN ABOVE LIST)
        (EMASM.CLI IS A MACRO IN :UTIL)

5.      LINK_ERMES
        (LINK_ERMES.CLI IS A MACRO IN :UTIL WHICH MAY NEED TO BE 
        EDITED TO INCLUDE NEW FILES)

     
     A SAMPLE OF THE STRUCTURE OF THE ERMES FILE IS GIVEN HERE:
     
      -----     ---------------------------------
        !       !                               !   LOC  0
        !       !  20000 2-DWORD ENTRIES, 1 PER !
        !       !  GROUP. 1ST DWORD=WORD ADDR   !
                !  OF GROUP'S CODE VECTOR TABLE,!
        1       !  2ND DWORD=LENGTH(DWDS) OF    !
                !  GROUPS CODE VECTOR TABLE     !
       PER      !                               !
                !--                           --!
      FILE      ! GROUP N CODE VECTOR TBL ADDR  !
                !--                           --!
        !       !    #CODES FOR GROUP N         !
      -----     !-------------------------------!
        !       !                               !  LOC 100000
        !       !   ERROR CODE -> TXT WORD PTRS !
        !       !   1 DWORD ENTRIES             !
        !       !        #CODES DWORDS LONG     !
        !       !                               !
                !                               !
        1       !--                           --!
                ! DWORD POINTER TO TXT FOR CODE ! PTR FOR ERROR CODE XXXXX
      PAIR      !--                           --!       !
                !                               !       !
       PER      !-------------------------------!       !
                !                               !       !
      GROUP     !       TEXT FOR GROUP          !       !
        !       !                               !       !
        !       !--                           --!       !
        !       ! TEXT FOR CODE XXXXX           !<------
        !       !--                           --!
        !       !                               !
        !       !                               !
      -----     !-------------------------------!
                !                               ! NEXT GROUP CODE VECTOR
                !                               !       TABLE
             
                =                               =
             
                !                               ! NEXT GROUPS TEXT AREA
                !                               !
                !                               !
                !-------------------------------!
                             ETC.
             

        .ENDC
        .END
